</div>

<p>Notably, the diffusion head outperforms the LM head on the same backbone — the binary denoising interface is not just comparable to the softmax, it's better on this task after fine-tuning. This suggests that joint within-block token generation has a real inductive bias advantage for language tasks with multi-word coherence requirements.</p>

